stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> unauthenticated
  unauthenticated --> authenticated: login valido
  authenticated --> expired: token vence / respuesta 401
  expired --> refreshing: primer 401 inicia refresh single-flight
  expired --> refreshing: 401 concurrente se une al refresh activo
  refreshing --> authenticated: refresh exitoso / reintentos una vez
  refreshing --> unauthenticated: refresh fallido / limpiar tokens
  authenticated --> unauthenticated: logout / limpiar tokens
  expired --> unauthenticated: logout / limpiar tokens
  refreshing --> unauthenticated: logout / descartar refresh tardio

  note right of authenticated
    Reportante consulta sus incidencias.
    Tecnico resuelve incidencias asignadas.
    Coordinador cierra y reabre incidencias.
  end note
